 "text": "Auditor — County of Meade\nHome\nMeade County\nMission Statement\nHistory\nNews/Notices\nPublic Notices\nOffices\nAuditor\nBoard of Commissioners\nEqualization/Planning\nElections\nEmergency Management\nFacilities - IT\nHighway\nHuman Resources\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran's Services\nCommunity Health Services\n4-H\nResources\nContact Us\nCalendar\nCommittees\nEmployment Opportunities\nEmployee Resources\nFloodplain and Stormwater\nForms & Documents\nGIS\nMeeting Agenda/Minutes\nOrdinances\nRally Information\nCounty of Meade\nHome\nMeade County\nMission Statement\nHistory\nNews/Notices\nPublic Notices\nOffices\nAuditor\nBoard of Commissioners\nEqualization/Planning\nElections\nEmergency Management\nFacilities - IT\nHighway\nHuman Resources\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran's Services\nCommunity Health Services\n4-H\nResources\nContact Us\nCalendar\nCommittees\nEmployment Opportunities\nEmployee Resources\nFloodplain and Stormwater\nForms & Documents\nGIS\nMeeting Agenda/Minutes\nOrdinances\nRally Information\nOffices\nAuditor\nBoard of Commissioners\nEqualization/Planning\nElections\nEmergency Management\nFacilities - IT\nHighway\nHuman Resources\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran's Services\nCommunity Health Services\n4-H\nCOUNTY AUDITOR\nDawn Christenson, Meade County Auditor\nTerm: Expires 2026\n1300 Sherman Street, Suite 126, Sturgis, SD 57785\n605.347.2360\nOffice Hours: 8 a.m. to 5 p.m., Mon. - Fri.\nContact Form\nName\nFirst Name (required)\nLast Name (required)\nEmail (required)\nSubject (required)\nMessage (required)\nSubmit Submit\nForms & Documents\nThe auditor is the keeper of county records and acts as a bookkeeper for county business. Records may include documents, books or minutes from county commission meetings.\nThe primary source of county revenue is through property taxes. However, only about 27% of all property taxes go to fund county government, while the remaining 73% are used to fund schools and other local entities. It is the auditor's responsibility to figure real estate and mobile home taxes. It should be noted that the auditor does not appraise property value, but rather figures the property appraisal into a tax levy, which is forwarded to the county treasurer for collection.\nPart of the county responsibility is to provide for the needy. In this aspect, many county auditors are generally given the task for handling indigent health care. Or rather, administering payment for medical services provided to people unable to pay for their treatment.\nReports\nAnnual Budgets\n2026\n2025\n2021\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n2009\nAnnual Reports\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n2009\n2008\nAudit Reports\n2021-2022\n2019-2020\n2017-2018\n2015-2016\nGrowth Reports\n2026\n2025\n2024\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n2009\nLevy Reports\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n2009\nMax Tax Payable Reports\n2023 -->\n2025\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\nConsumer Price Index 2025 ( PDF )\nConsumer Price Index 2026 ( PDF )\nHome\nCalendar\nContact Us\nScoreboard\nGIS\nBoard Docs\nMeade County YouTube Live\nBack to Top\nMeade County, 1300 Sherman Street, Sturgis, SD, 57785, United States\nCopyright 2022, Meade County. All rights reserved.",
